description:
They connect people and nature through tourism, conservation and development activities as a challenge to discover Patagonia;
They explore the passion to discover Patagonia through the connections between people and nature;
They improve the lives of guests by providing them with unique travel experiences, with a deep connection with nature and people, through a close and personalized service while they generate wealth and regional development while conserving and protecting Patagonia and the planet.

Conectamos a las personas y a la naturaleza a través de actividades de turismo, de conservación y de desarrollo como desafío para descubrir la Patagonia;
Exploramos la pasión por descubrir la Patagonia a través de las conexiones entre las personas y la naturaleza;
Mejoramos la vida de nuestros huéspedes brindándoles experiencias de viaje únicas, con una conexión profunda con la naturaleza y las personas, a través de un servicio cercano y personalizado mientras generamos riqueza y desarrollo regional conservando y protegiendo a la Patagonia y al planeta.

Tokoro Capital is a regulated investment advisor to off-shore funds that acquire: (i) direct real estate in the UK and Europe; 
(ii) real estate backed operating businesses, and 
(iii) real estate related debt and securities.

Savo is a fast-growing Africa focused investment and project development company with a specialisation in sustainable asset classes and complex transactions. 

With USD 70 million in transactions closed, we achieved revenue growth of 200% in 2021 and have generated USD 1 million in profit in less than 2 years of operation. Spanning the spectrum of project development and transaction support, we provide end-to-end advisory services and take equity in companies. Our core focus is developing sustainable businesses and setting companies up for success. To date, we have closed deals in Kenya, Ethiopia, Madagascar, Uganda, Cameroon and Nigeria. Assets include; sustainable industrial parks; port development;
affordable housing; captive power; sustainable sourcing, and; carbon asset development. We are headquartered in London, with our first subsidiary in Kenya later this year.

The Mingori family has been in the construction business for five generations. In fact, it was in 1895 that Domenico Mingori set up the first self-run construction company.

Over time, the company has specialised in the following activities:

Execution and maintenance, in particular as General Contractor, of building and plant engineering works of all kinds;
The design and engineering of general and specialist construction works in the civil, industrial and commercial fields;
Turnkey construction of any type of construction, both public and private, even of large dimensions and high quality standards;
Participation in public and private tenders in Italy and abroad.

Es una empresa de asistencia integral, estando en el mercado hace más de 37 años brindando contención, ofreciendo soluciones inmediatas con calidad y cordialidad, siempre abocados a superar las expectativas de sus clientes.
Interasistencia cuenta con una amplia línea de negocios enfocados en cubrir las necesidades del cliente.
Están comprometidos con el crecimiento y desarrollo de sus colaboradores y aliados estratégicos, extendiendo así la cultura de innovación y la mejora continua en su entorno. Su misión empresarial es ser líderes en servicios de calidad, creando vínculos sostenibles desde Paraguay y al mundo. La asistencia al cliente es su meta diaria.
Cuenta con un call center propio y nacional brindando atención los 365 días del año las 24 horas.
Propósito: Trabajamos para facilitar la vida de nuestros clientes, desde la cercanía, conteniendo y conectándolos con soluciones eficientes para sus necesidades.
Visión: Ser líderes en servicios de calidad, creando vínculos sostenibles desde Paraguay y al mundo.

